<title>TURKEY: SOCCER-LECHKOV IN TALKS ON BESIKTAS TRANSFER.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-LECHKOV IN TALKS ON BESIKTAS TRANSFER.</headline>
<dateline>ISTANBUL 1997-07-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bulgarian international midfielder Yordan Lechkov was in Istanbul on Sunday for talks on a possible transfer to leading Turkish team Besiktas.</p>
<p>Lechkov, who was transfer-listed by Marseille after a year at the French club, is to meet Besiktas's Welsh coach John Toshack before a final decision on the move.</p>
<p>Besiktas will compete in the European Cup this coming season after finishing second in the Turkish league last season.</p>
